<h1>Newsroom</h1>

<p>Updates on investment, site news and community activity across our three locations. Journalists and industry contacts looking for further detail or a comment should use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

<div class="panel">
    <article>
        <h2>Furnace upgrade completed at the Sheffield foundry</h2>
        <p class="meta">10 February 2026</p>
        <p>A six-week rebuild of the number two induction furnace at our Sheffield site has been completed, adding waste-heat recovery that will reduce gas use during the melting stage.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
        <h2>New five-axis machining cell commissioned at Wrexham</h2>
        <p class="meta">3 November 2025</p>
        <p>The Wrexham plant has brought a new five-axis machining cell into production, adding capacity for complex housings that previously required two separate setups.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
        <h2>Meridian Castings supports National Apprenticeship Week</h2>
        <p class="meta">1 October 2025</p>
        <p>Sheffield and Wrexham hosted local school groups as part of National Apprenticeship Week, giving pupils a tour of the foundry and machine shop ahead of this year's graduate and apprentice recruitment.</p>
    </article>
</div>

